  "details": "I would like to propose the implementation of a setting that allows users to adjust the duration for which HUD notifications are displayed, similar to the chatbox settings.\n\nHaving the notifications visible for a longer period than the default setting can be beneficial for several reasons:\n\nModeration: It allows moderators to read usernames more easily, ensuring better oversight.\n\nAccessibility: Extended visibility can improve accessibility for users who may need a little more time to read notifications.",
